<title>UK: London gold fixes firmer after Wall Street tumble.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes firmer after Wall Street tumble.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes firmer at $326.05 versus $324.65 and London close of $324.10/$324.60. Firmer after sharp decline in U.S. stocks on Friday. But market still cautious, prices firmly rangebound.</p>
<p>SILVER - Up eight cents at $4.52/$4.54 after fund-led rally on Friday. Seen stabilising around $4.50.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Up $2.00 at $425.00/$428.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Little changed at $210.00/$213.00.</p>
</text>
